        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gianni Agnelli\n- Companies: Fiat, Fiat Chrysler Automobiles N.V., Volkswagen Group, Bugatti\n- Products: Bugatti Veyron, Ascari A10\n- Events: Supercar Challenge (video game), Ascari competition\n\nFacts:\n- Gianni Agnelli was the chairman of Fabbrica Italiana Automobili Torino (Fiat).\n- Fiat later merged into the Netherlands-based holding company Fiat Chrysler Automobiles N.V.\n- Volkswagen Group is the car company that makes Bugatti.\n- The Bugatti Veyron is a Bugatti car featured in Supercar Challenge.\n- An Ascari competition in Supercar Challenge involves the Ascari car brand, and one of its judges is identified through the Fiat chairman clue as Gianni Agnelli.",
